      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Mh. I have a feeling that when creators leave the game, they wouldn't take the time to use the Archived tag. If they have a little time on their hands and want to clean up their profile of older, unmaintained worlds, there's already the option for them to make them private and create a portal world with a fair warning letting users know that those worlds might have issue.\n\nIn my opinion, creators already have tools to handle that specific case should they wish it, and I assume most of them just wouldn't bother.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
